{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S03、S04、S13等时长较短或感受提示密集的段落，容易让观众忙着追小字，X的左右分栏更容易一眼扫全。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】突出每段心理变化的关键抓手，观众更容易迅速抓住人物此刻在想什么；同时把舍不得、受委屈、怕孤单、渴望亲近之间的因果关系交代得清楚。它从离开后的轻松，到怀念、动摇、自我辨认，再到决定带着想念继续生活，反复呼应了被当作自己人的渴望和不愿再忍受委屈的底线。尤其音乐感受按时点出现，具体音响、身体感受和人物心理能够互相印证，细腻程度明显胜过X；X的优势是版面整齐、快速浏览方便，但右侧提示较概括，部分音乐变化和情绪层次没有充分展开。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0b84d3d5-7c12-4137-9f3f-38183ef0f147", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T090648168349Z", "elapsed_seconds": 146.094, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T09:09:14.276144+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "616fe73da94f357f9c61eea50a8d1f075948c600e67e5e4ce1fd427eaffa221b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308